  <div class="info-lead"><p>Make ideas work.</p><p>Still Coding is an independent practice by JH Kim. It introduces browser games, learning tools, music, collaboration, and urban exploration apps that are designed, built, and operated directly.</p></div>
  <section class="info-section"><p class="section-number">01 / WHAT WE MAKE</p><h2>Small questions,<br /><em>working experiences.</em></h2><p>Each app starts with a question and becomes something you can open in a browser. The detail pages explain each app's purpose, setup, storage, and permissions.</p></section>
  <section class="info-section"><p class="section-number">02 / THE MAKER</p><h2>JH Kim</h2><p>I design ideas, build them in code, and run them directly. For questions or feedback, use the <a class="text-link" href="/en/contact/">contact page</a>. Development notes are published in Korean at <a class="text-link" href="/notes/" hreflang="ko">/notes/</a>.</p></section>
